            <g id="gCore" data-tip="The weight-tied loop body. Huginn: 4 layers, 1.5 B params; Parcae-1.3B: 8 layers; LOTUS: the ENTIRE pretrained 3B backbone, looped over only the latent positions." data-tip-ko="Weight-tied loop 본체. Huginn: 4 layers, 1.5 B params; Parcae-1.3B: 8 layers; LOTUS: 사전학습된 3B backbone 전체를 latent 위치들에만 반복 적용.">
